[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the receiver.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Alarm remote control receiver</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890818\">M35</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Recover the receiver.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035501.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the receiver is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the receiver and fix it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p><p>Connect the battery.</p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or the other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]